@ko_ballot_collapse
# prose-audit: Grade A — The Civic bloc's collapse is caused by the count the player just produced and sized by it: the band, the wing that loses the internal argument and the fate of the junior parties are all fixed before any choice appears, so Lewica decides what to do with a hegemony that has already ended rather than whether to end it.
title: The Civic bloc is not on the ballot
subtitle: KO's claim to lead the opposition depended on reaching the runoff; Lewica decides what replaces it
face-image: img/poland/events/borysbudka.jpg
new-page: true
view-if: ko_2020_runoff_miss = 1 and ko_2020_crisis_done = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.ko_2020_crisis_done = 1;
const koFall = Number(Q.ko_2020_humiliation) || 14;
// A result this bad does not merely cost KO a campaign. Koalicja Obywatelska
// is an electoral alliance rather than a party, and below eight per cent none
// of its junior parties has a reason left to stand on somebody else's list.
// All three leave, and what remains is Platforma Obywatelska under its own
// name, badge and colour — the coalition simply stops existing.
if (Q.ko_2020_miss_band == "Annihilation") {
    const record = function(id) {
        return (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(entry) {
            return entry.id == id;
        });
    };
    let leavers = 0;
    for (const id of ["nowoczesna", "ipl", "greens"]) {
        const party = record(id);
        if (!party || !party.active) continue;
        const seats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(party.mp_count) || 0));
        party.allied = 0;
        party.independent = 1;
        party.parent = "No electoral committee";
        party.legal_status = "registered party outside the Civic bloc";
        party.list_committee = id;
        party.club = id;
        party.exclusive_seats = seats;
        party.sejm_mps = seats;
        party.relation = Math.min(100, (Number(party.relation) || 40) + 10);
        leavers += seats;
    }
    // The committee record is retired and PO stops being a component of
    // anything. The `ko` key stays as the internal handle for the surviving
    // party; every name, badge and colour the player sees resolves to PO.
    const koCommittee = record("ko_party");
    if (koCommittee) {
        koCommittee.active = 0;
        koCommittee.allied = 0;
        koCommittee.legal_status = "dissolved electoral alliance";
        koCommittee.parent = "No electoral committee";
        koCommittee.mp_count = 0;
        koCommittee.sejm_mps = 0;
        koCommittee.exclusive_seats = 0;
    }
    const po = record("po");
    if (po) {
        po.parent = "Platforma Obywatelska";
        po.legal_status = "registered party";
    }
    Q.ko_2020_alliance_broken = 1;
    Q.ko_2020_alliance_leavers = leavers;
    Q.ko_seats = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) - leavers);
    Q.ko_cohesion = Math.max(10, (Number(Q.ko_cohesion) || 40) - 6);
    Q.ko_collapse_shock = (Number(Q.ko_collapse_shock) || 0) + 10;
    Q.ko_leader = Q.ko_leader == "Barbara Nowacka" ||
        Q.ko_leader == "Adam Szłapka"
        ? "Borys Budka"
        : Q.ko_leader;
}
Q.ko_2020_blamed_wing = Q.pres_2020_ko_kidawa
    ? "the parliamentary old guard that defended the primary"
    : "the metropolitan campaign that was supposed to be the safe choice";
Q.news_headline = Q.ko_2020_alliance_broken
    ? "Koalicja Obywatelska breaks up after KO's " +
        Q.ko_2020_r1_share + "%"
    : "KO's " + Q.ko_2020_r1_share +
        "% ends its claim to lead the opposition";
!}

= June 2020 — [+ ko_2020_r1_share +]% and no second ballot

For five years every conversation in the democratic camp began from the same
premise: KO is the only opposition party large enough to beat PiS, therefore
everybody else stands aside, moderates, endorses and waits. The premise was
never a poll number. It was the runoff.

[? if ko_2020_miss_band = "Beaten into third": **[+ pres_2020_ko_name +]** ran
a real campaign and was beaten to the second ballot anyway. KO can survive [+
ko_2020_r1_share +]% as an organisation. What it cannot do is repeat the
sentence about being the only vehicle, because the country has just watched
somebody else be that vehicle.?]
[? if ko_2020_miss_band = "Humiliation": **[+ pres_2020_ko_name +]** finishes
on [+ ko_2020_r1_share +]% — a number KO's own regional structures cannot
explain to their members. The party that has claimed the anti-PiS electorate
since 2015 did not come close to the ballot that decides who governs from the
Palace.?]
[? if ko_2020_miss_band = "Annihilation": **[+ pres_2020_ko_name +]** finishes
on [+ ko_2020_r1_share +]%. This is not a defeat; it is a party ceasing to be
the thing it said it was. Regional boards are meeting tonight without telling
the national executive.?]

**[+ pres_r1_leader_name +]** and **[+ pres_r1_runner_name +]** contest the
runoff. The blame inside KO settles on [+ ko_2020_blamed_wing +], and it will
not be settled quickly, because the wing being blamed controls the lists.

[? if ko_2020_alliance_broken: <b>Koalicja Obywatelska stops existing.</b> It
was never a party — it was a committee, and a committee is a promise about
arithmetic. Nowoczesna, Inicjatywa Polska and Zieloni all announce they will
not stand on a Civic list again: **[+ ko_2020_alliance_leavers +] MPs** leave
the club and register their own. What is left keeps the offices, the debts and
the old name it never stopped using in private — **Platforma Obywatelska**,
alone on a ballot for the first time since 2018. Two of the departures are
progressive parties with no floor under them, and both know exactly which
party is calling by Tuesday.?]
[? if not ko_2020_alliance_broken: The coalition holds — barely. Nowoczesna,
Inicjatywa Polska and Zieloni stay inside the Civic committee because leaving
in June costs more than staying, and every one of them says so out loud, which
is its own kind of announcement.?]

Whatever we do now, one thing is already finished: no Left voter in this
country will be told again that a vote for us wastes the only realistic
chance of removing PiS. That argument died at [+ ko_2020_r1_share +]%.

- @ko_collapse_2020_inherit
- @ko_collapse_2020_front
- @ko_collapse_2020_absorb

@ko_collapse_2020_inherit
title: Claim the vacancy: the Left is now the opposition's centre of gravity
subtitle: Maximum differentiation and the strongest pull on KO's orphaned voters; KO treats us as the party that buried it.
on-arrival: {!
Q.ko_2020_crisis_response = "Claim the vacancy";
Q.party_system_left_pull = (Number(Q.party_system_left_pull) || 0) + 6;
Q.left_poll_momentum = (Number(Q.left_poll_momentum) || 0) + 0.45;
Q.media_capacity = (Number(Q.media_capacity) || 0) + 3;
Q.leadership_authority = (Number(Q.leadership_authority) || 0) + 4;
Q.tactical_desertion_to_ko = Math.max(
    0, (Number(Q.tactical_desertion_to_ko) || 0) * 0.6
);
Q.ko_relation = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0) - 9);
Q.ko_coalition_dissent = (Number(Q.ko_coalition_dissent) || 0) + 6;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica says the opposition has a new centre of gravity";
!}

We do not commiserate. Every appearance this week says the same sentence: the
strategy of concentrating the anti-PiS vote in one liberal party was tested on
Sunday and it failed, and the people who spent five years enforcing it owe an
explanation to everybody they enforced it on.

It is the most useful week the Left has had since 2015 and it costs us any
pretence of a friendly relationship with what remains of KO's leadership, who
will spend the rest of the term telling journalists we kicked a party that was
already down. They are not entirely wrong.

- @ko_collapse_2020_result: Read the settlement

@ko_collapse_2020_front
title: Hold the democratic front together and let KO keep its dignity
subtitle: Protects the runoff coalition and the Senate pact; the vacancy stays open for somebody else to fill.
on-arrival: {!
Q.ko_2020_crisis_response = "Hold the front together";
Q.ko_relation = (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0) + 8;
Q.public_trust = (Number(Q.public_trust) || 0) + 2;
Q.constitutional_restraint = (Number(Q.constitutional_restraint) || 0) + 3;
Q.pres_runoff_preparation = (Number(Q.pres_runoff_preparation) || 0) + 0.6;
Q.party_unity = (Number(Q.party_unity) || 0) - 2;
Q.razem_dissent = (Number(Q.razem_dissent) || 0) + 5;
Q.p2050_poll_momentum = (Number(Q.p2050_poll_momentum) || 0) + 0.5;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica declines to campaign against a collapsing KO";
!}

There is a runoff in four weeks and a Senate majority that only exists because
these parties stopped competing in single-member seats. We say nothing about
KO's result that a KO politician could quote against us, and we get a
functioning democratic coalition for July in exchange.

The vacancy does not stay empty because we were polite about it. Hołownia's
volunteers are already in the towns we did not go to, and Razem's organisers
want to know precisely what we were paid for the silence.

- @ko_collapse_2020_result: Read the settlement

@ko_collapse_2020_absorb
title: Go for the progressive wing and the orphaned partners
subtitle: Organisational rather than rhetorical: list places, staff and offices for the people KO can no longer pay.
on-arrival: {!
Q.ko_2020_crisis_response = "Recruit the progressive wing";
Q.progressive_credibility = (Number(Q.progressive_credibility) || 0) + 4;
Q.local_network = (Number(Q.local_network) || 0) + 4;
Q.organiser_energy = (Number(Q.organiser_energy) || 0) - 3;
Q.resources = (Number(Q.resources) || 0) - 1;
Q.ko_relation = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0) - 5);
Q.ko_social_liberal_share = Math.max(
    0, (Number(Q.ko_social_liberal_share) || 42) - 5
);
Q.ko_classical_liberal_share = 100 - Q.ko_social_liberal_share;
Q.barons_dissent = (Number(Q.barons_dissent) || 0) + 4;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica opens its lists to KO's progressive organisers";
!}

Nothing is said on television. Offers go out in writing instead: regional
office space, staff contracts, winnable places in 2023 and a programme that
does not need translating for anybody who spent the last five years losing KO
internal votes on housing, schools and rights.

Our own regional secretaries are told which of those places have just stopped
being theirs, and say what regional secretaries always say. The gain is not
visible this month. It is visible in every constituency where somebody else's
structure used to be.

- @ko_collapse_2020_result: Read the settlement

@ko_collapse_2020_result
title: The opposition after the Civic bloc
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const recruiting = Q.ko_2020_crisis_response == "Recruit the progressive wing";
// Only the recruitment line converts the orphaned partners into Left seats;
// the other two leave them independent and available to anybody.
if (Q.ko_2020_alliance_broken && recruiting) {
    const record = function(id) {
        return (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(entry) {
            return entry.id == id;
        });
    };
    const ipl = record("ipl");
    const greens = record("greens");
    const iplSeats = ipl ? Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(ipl.mp_count) || 0)) : 0;
    const greenSeats = greens
        ? Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(greens.mp_count) || 0))
        : 0;
    const joined = iplSeats + greenSeats;
    if (joined > 0) {
        Q.ipl_joined_left = 1;
        Q.left_ipl_current_seats = iplSeats;
        if (greenSeats > 0) {
            Q.greens_joined_left = 1;
            Q.left_green_current_seats = greenSeats;
        }
        Q.left_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) || 0) + joined;
        Q.left_progressives_seats =
            Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_progressives_seats) || 0) + joined;
        Q.progressives_strength =
            (Number(Q.progressives_strength) || 0) + 4;
        Q.ko_2020_alliance_recruits = joined;
    }
}
Q.ko_2020_crisis_result = Q.ko_2020_alliance_broken
    ? (Q.ko_2020_alliance_recruits > 0
        ? "Koalicja Obywatelska dissolves back into PO and " +
            Q.ko_2020_alliance_recruits + " of its MPs join the Left"
        : "Koalicja Obywatelska dissolves back into Platforma Obywatelska")
    : "KO survives the night without its claim to lead the opposition";
!}

= [+ ko_2020_crisis_result +]

[? if not ko_2020_alliance_broken: KO does not disappear. It keeps a caucus, a
name, a machine and a [+ ko_2020_r1_share +]% presidential result that every
rival will quote at it until 2023. What it has lost is the argument — the one
that made every other democratic party a junior partner by default — and that
argument was the whole basis of the last five years of opposition politics.?]

[? if ko_2020_alliance_broken: The name goes first. Committees are registered
and deregistered by a court clerk, and Koalicja Obywatelska was only ever a
committee: an agreement between four organisations that a common list would
deliver a government. It delivered [+ ko_2020_r1_share +]%. **Platforma
Obywatelska** takes back its own name, its own badge and its own colour, and
keeps the caucus, the offices and the debts. Everybody who spent five years
described as a KO politician is now described as whatever they actually
are.
That is a smaller party than the one that went into Sunday, and it has lost
more than [+ ko_2020_alliance_leavers +] MPs. It has lost the argument that
made every other democratic party a junior partner by default, which was the
whole basis of the last five years of opposition politics.?]

[? if ko_2020_alliance_recruits > 0: **[+ ko_2020_alliance_recruits +] MPs**
from Inicjatywa Polska and Zieloni now sit with us. They bring constituency
organisations rather than only votes, and a permanent internal argument about
what the Left is now for. Nowoczesna went nowhere near us and did not have to
be asked twice about it.?]
[? if ko_2020_alliance_broken and ko_2020_alliance_recruits = 0: Nowoczesna,
Inicjatywa Polska and Zieloni sit as their own parties with **[+
ko_2020_alliance_leavers +] MPs** between them, no floor under any of them,
and no agreement with anybody. Somebody will make them an offer. It does not
have to be us.?]

Our line was **[+ ko_2020_crisis_response +]**.

Whoever leads [? if ko_2020_alliance_broken: Platforma Obywatelska?][? if not
ko_2020_alliance_broken: KO?] next inherits a party that cannot say the
sentence any more. When the founder is eventually recalled to fix it — and he
will be — he will be returning to a smaller job than the one he thinks he is
taking.

- @ko_collapse_2020_record

@ko_collapse_2020_record
title: Return to the leadership table
go-to: poland_hub

@runoff_setup
# prose-audit: Grade A — The endorsement fork was always correct; the fortnight beneath it now reads. Each of the four lines reports what was signed and what it cost inside the party, and every seat in the support market says who was in the room, what they could actually deliver and who paid for it.
title: The second ballot
face-image: img/poland/events/polling-station-2025.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.reckoning_event_done = 1;
if (Q.pres_first_round_complete && !Q.pres_first_round_majority &&
    !Q.pres_runoff_complete && !Q.pres_runoff_initialized) {
    Q.pres_runoff_initialized = 1;
    Q.pres_2020_phase = "Runoff campaign";
    Q.pres_support_actions_remaining = 2;
    Q.pres_support_holownia = 0;
    Q.pres_support_psl = 0;
    Q.pres_support_ko = 0;
    Q.pres_support_movements = 0;
    Q.pres_support_bosak = 0;
    Q.pres_support_turnout = 0;
    Q.pres_support_release = 0;
    Q.pres_runoff_target_bonus = 0;
    Q.pres_trade_left_boost = 0;
    Q.pres_trade_holownia_boost = 0;
    Q.pres_trade_psl_boost = 0;
    Q.pres_trade_ko_boost = 0;
    Q.pres_trade_bosak_boost = 0;
    Q.pres_runoff_endorsement = "Not chosen";
    Q.pres_runoff_campaign = "Not chosen";
    Q.pres_runoff_final_push = "Not chosen";
    Q.pres_runoff_poll_shock =
        (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296 - 0.5) *
        (Q.hard_mode ? 2.1 : 1.8);
    Q.pres_runoff_result_shock =
        (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296 - 0.5) *
        (Q.hard_mode ? 2.8 : 2.3);
    Q.pres_runoff_turnout_shock =
        (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296 - 0.5) * 0.8;
    const finalists = [
        Q.pres_finalist_a_key,
        Q.pres_finalist_b_key
    ];
    if (finalists.includes("left")) {
        Q.pres_runoff_support_key = "left";
        Q.pres_runoff_support_name = Q.presidential_candidate;
        Q.pres_left_is_finalist = 1;
    } else if (finalists.includes("trzaskowski")) {
        Q.pres_runoff_support_key = "trzaskowski";
        Q.pres_runoff_support_name =
            Q.pres_2020_ko_name || "Rafał Trzaskowski";
        Q.pres_left_is_finalist = 0;
    } else if (finalists.includes("holownia")) {
        Q.pres_runoff_support_key = "holownia";
        Q.pres_runoff_support_name = "Szymon Hołownia";
        Q.pres_left_is_finalist = 0;
    } else if (finalists.includes("kosiniak")) {
        Q.pres_runoff_support_key = "kosiniak";
        Q.pres_runoff_support_name = "Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz";
        Q.pres_left_is_finalist = 0;
    } else if (finalists.includes("duda")) {
        Q.pres_runoff_support_key = "duda";
        Q.pres_runoff_support_name = "Andrzej Duda";
        Q.pres_left_is_finalist = 0;
    } else {
        Q.pres_runoff_support_key = Q.pres_finalist_a_key;
        Q.pres_runoff_support_name = Q.pres_finalist_a_name;
        Q.pres_left_is_finalist = 0;
    }
    const relationByTarget = {
        trzaskowski: Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0,
        holownia: Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0,
        kosiniak: Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0,
        duda: Number(Q.president_relation) || 0,
        bosak: Number(Q.konf_relation) || 0,
        left: 100
    };
    Q.pres_runoff_target_relation =
        relationByTarget[Q.pres_runoff_support_key] || 0;
}
!}
go-to: setup if pres_first_round_complete = 0

